Scope

This license covers the original work in this repository: code/ann_vs_snn_ecg/,
code/ann_vs_snn_mnist/pynq/, code/ann_vs_snn_mnist/demo/, the changes to
code/ann_vs_snn_mnist/ beyond the course skeleton, the overnight sweep
scripts in code/, the SNN and MAC coprocessors in code/pynqz2_riscv_flow/
(rtl/snn_pcpi.v, rtl/mac_pcpi.v, sim/, vivado/build_snn.tcl, build_mac.tcl,
build_both.tcl, the SNN_COPROC / MAC_COPROC options in rtl/spike_soc.v and
the build.tcl hooks), and docs/ (except docs/course/).

It does NOT cover third-party or course material, which keeps its own terms:
  * code/pynqz2_riscv_flow/rtl/picorv32.v  PicoRV32, (c) Claire Xenia Wolf,
                                           ISC license (see the file header)
  * code/pynqz2_riscv_flow/vivado/board_files/  PYNQ-Z2 board files, (c) TUL
  * third_party/muriscv-nn/  muRISCV-NN (git submodule, unmodified),
                             (c) TUM / Arm, Apache License 2.0 (see its LICENSE)
  * the 5XPG0 course template (TU Eindhoven, F. Corradi): the rest of
    code/pynqz2_riscv_flow/, code/snn_keyword/, the original skeletons of
    code/ann_vs_snn_mnist/, PresentationInstruction/, ProjectPitch/ and
    docs/course/. No license was granted for these; all rights remain with
    their authors.
  * Datasets are not included. MNIST and the MIT-BIH Arrhythmia Database
    (PhysioNet, ODC-By 1.0) are downloaded by the scripts under their own terms.
